    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Beata sibeawa Misri ea eahita Moabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh wuseanyeeka fuga Israeli, damanda riteawa ng'eanyiida Misri aba eemoojiga nyaawa nea ghoadoabiiw Musa sea Haruni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'oar Musa gidariteayda aba wuseanyeeka nyaawa, aba diigheanda NG'UTAMIIDA; ak suh ea wuseanyeeka nyaawa aba iyang'eat ghuuta ng'eayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghoang'eada beata Ramesesi sheeda madeeda, eaweeteaba damanamuut bea sheeda madeeda; eaweeteaba iyeenya iing'ata Basaaka, gwarita gaweay fuga Israeli aba geatinda mideawa uurda aba madeeda gheanyanga fuga sean bea Misri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "damanda bunya fuga Misri duweachajeega nyaawa sean, damanda bwara NG'UTAMIIDA aba jeenyaawa; ak ghoahiimda gideaba gwandeawa uurda ng'al dea aseecheeka nyaawa; eara ada ghoahiimu NG'UTAMIIDA girgweaksiinda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghabeawa fuga Israeli ng'eanyiida Ramesesi, ak gooduuw aba Sukoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghabeawa Sukoti, ak gooduuw aba Etamu, mida ghuuta dareapcheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabeawa Etamu, ak gabiikta ghwayam geat gabiikta ea ghwahita Bi-hahiroti deaschi sea Baal-sefoni; ak gooduuw aba madeeda Migdoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghabeawa madeeda Hahiroti, ak ghwalach bugusta basooda ak gaweay jeeda dareapcheeda; ak gaweay beata askwearjooji samwagu aba dareapcheeda Etamu, ak gooduuw aba Meara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghabeawa Meara, ak ghwahita Elimu; hoowa bea Elimuun gwanda gheanyan damaniyeenya bea eeniga, ea miilay laadam ea damanamughuush; ak gooduuwsa hiji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabeawa Elimu ak gooduuw aba riiksiinda basooda Shaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghabeawa basooda Shaamu, ak gooduuw aba dareapcheeda Sini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghabeawa dareapcheeda Sini, ak gooduuw aba Dofka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghabeawa Dofka, ak gooduuw aba Alushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghabeawa Alushi, ak gooduuw aba Refidimu, was heeda manda beega jea ghwali buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabeawa Refidimu, ak gooduuw aba dareapcheeda Sinayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghabeawa dareapcheeda Sinayi, ak gooduuw aba Gibrot-hataafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghabeawa Gibrot-hataafa, ak gooduuw aba Haseroti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghabeawa Haseroti, ak gooduuw aba Ritma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghabeawa Ritma, ak gooduuw aba Rimon-peresi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghabeawa Rimon-peresi, ak gooduuw aba Libna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabeawa Libna, ak gooduuw aba Risa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghabeawa Risa, ak gooduuw aba Gehelata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghabeawa Gehelata, ak gooduuw aba giijeeda Sheferi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabeawa Sheferi, ak gooduuw aba Harada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu gabeewa Harada, ak gooduuw aba Makeloti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghabeawa Makeloti, ak gooduuw aba Dahati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabeawa Dahati, ak gooduuw aba Dera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghabeawa Dera, ak gooduuw aba Mitka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghabeawa Mitka, ak gooduuw aba Hashmona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghabeawa Hashmona, ak gooduuw aba Moseroti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghabeawa Moseroti, ak gooduuw aba Bene-yaakani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghabeawa Bene-yaakani, ak gooduuw aba Hor-hagidgadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghabeawa Hor-hagidgadi, ak gooduuw aba Yotbata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghabeawa Yotbata, ak gooduuw aba Abrona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghabeawa Abrona, ak gooduuw aba Esion-geberi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghabeawa Esion-geberi, ak gooduuw aba dareapcheeda Sini (nea Gadeshi). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabeawa Gadeshi, ak gooduuw aba giijeeda Hori, mida moonghooda ng'eanyiida Edomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwading'da Haruni giijeeda Hori, aba diigheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gameewsa hoowa, aba gweaydeaba haradam iing'ata rinooda rinna fuga Israeli ng'eanyiida Misri, sheedeaba muut, was eaweeda madeeda bea sheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Haruni siida mideawa gweanyeew bughala ea diktam ea samwagu damanda meawa aba uhuuda giijeeda Hori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida Ganaani, was sugoocheanda Araadi, abiita ng'eanyiida Negebu was ng'eanyiida Ganaani, ghwayiiy hinnooda fuga Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghabeawa giijeeda Hori, ak gooduuw aba Salmona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghabeawa Salmona, ak gooduuw aba Bunoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabeawa Bunoni, ak gooduuw aba Oboti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabeawa Oboti, ak gooduuw aba Iye-abarimu, mida moonghooda ng'eanyiida Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghabeawa Iye-abarimu, ak gooduuw aba Dibon-gadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghabeawa Dibon-gadi, ak gooduuw aba Almon-diblatayimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghabeawa Almon-diblatayimu, ak gooduuw aba giijeega Abarimu, deaschi Nebo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabeawa giijeega Abarimu, ak gooduuw aba ng'eanyiida moohajeega Moabu, neekeewa eenda Yordani mida Yeriko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gooduuw aba murdeeda Yordani, ghang'eada Bet-yeshimoti ea ghwahita Abel-shitimu mida ng'eanyiida moohajeega Moabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheega sirukusa nea miighoaghaawa Yordani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gabalool NG'UTAMIIDA sea Musa aba moohajeega Moabu, neekeewa Yordani, aba Yeriko, ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Baloola sea fuga Israeli, ak giyeeshi, iyoakghaawi eenda Yordani ak gooweayi jeeda ng'eanyiida Ganaani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gajahoana buuneesean bea ng'eanyiita aba madeedeang'wa, ak gajadatasa lagheanga nyaawa sean sing'oorsa sanaamu, ak geadatas sanaamajeega nyaawa sean sisin, ak geenyarja hoorgajeega nyaawa sean gadiyeata gheambiideadi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gajoopiidana jeedeaba ng'eanyiini ak goombali nea goopiidi jeeda; aba gideaba aniini neagoonyeegwa agooga ng'eanyiini oombala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak agooga gajahearana ng'eanyiida aba ng'alealeeda, aba gidabeada fuga ghaheang'wa; fuga saang'a gajoatawa gea saang'a jea gwahearan, nea fuga ng'ay gajadawa aba giteena ng'ayinda nyaawa; aba heeda wassean abissa, ng'alealeeda siida wassean, hiji abeeda headaanyi; gajahearaniischeena awuurjeewana eemoojiga ghweanigeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama moogasi ahoana fuga bea ng'eanyiida ghabeawa madeedeang'wa, abeeda fiisu jea alajaan gaygawuurji sidageeda aba gheanyangeagwa, nea gawuurji halaghweenga aba gisheajeegeagwa, ak gaygoodeawiideegwa aba ng'eanyiini oopiidiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda gaygwasa, gawuurji gideagasiidi dasima saawa, nih gichea dasimaneegwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
